{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Ghostly Acres</strong>, an inn for ghostly travelers. Mel inherited the manor from her Uncle a few months ago. Though the house is amazing, her Uncle still owes <i>a lot</i> of coins to the bank. Oh, and it's haunted! ... by Flip the Ghost. Determined to keep their home, Mel and Flip team up to run the inn and pay back the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your help, Mel and Flip can pay off her Uncle's loan from the bank and keep their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carpenter in his past life, Flip can build whatever you need. Beds give your guests a place to stay, but make sure your inn is full of food, drink, and entertainment machines to bring in plenty of coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/98448f520a473604bc1573a2ba087f24.poster.avif?t=1759727085\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/98448f520a473604bc1573a2ba087f24.webm?t=1759727085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/98448f520a473604bc1573a2ba087f24.mp4?t=1759727085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mel needs your help to collect coins and gems from machines and pick up trash left by the guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/d183612f6d6b86b822686331b4e5cafe.poster.avif?t=1759727085\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/d183612f6d6b86b822686331b4e5cafe.webm?t=1759727085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/d183612f6d6b86b822686331b4e5cafe.mp4?t=1759727085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/bf56b39e977a66d7dfe26972074fb099.poster.avif?t=1759727085\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/bf56b39e977a66d7dfe26972074fb099.webm?t=1759727085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/bf56b39e977a66d7dfe26972074fb099.mp4?t=1759727085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay to open up new capabilities for the inn, like upgrades, decor, and even some suped-up machines. Clear off dusty old tiles to open up new space to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/43f3505bb027d2176efef3705b87be29.poster.avif?t=1759727085\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/43f3505bb027d2176efef3705b87be29.webm?t=1759727085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/extras/43f3505bb0